Package: orthoMTL
Type: Package
Title: Multitask learning with Orthogonal Constraints
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Kevin Vervier
Maintainer: Kevin Vervier <kevin.vervier@novartis.com>
Description: This package intends at fitting multitask learning models.
    It implements a penalty with orthogonality constraints developed in Vervier et al., 2014.
    Applications include (but not limited to) multiclass classification, as well as survival data.
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
